Z||000025||stimpy||08-18-2001||12:31 PM||||I've been doing some checking of spots. The state lodge at Texoma is just about 10 miles north of the border off of TX Route 377 in Kingston. I should be getting some brochures sent with rates for lodging (around $60 a night, camping is very cheap). LOTS to do. <P>What do y'all think?||||reg||1
